 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Pul king of Assyria invaded the land",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Menahem gave him a thousand talents of silver",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To gain his support and secure his hold",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Menahem raised the silver from every wealthy man",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Exacting fifty shekels to pay the king",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So the king of Assyria withdrew and did not remain",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The king who withdrew did not stay in the land",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Silver collected from the men of Israel",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A thousand talents paid for safety and peace",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The army turned away from the kingdom's gate",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Tiglath-Pileser came against Ijon and Abel",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Capturing Janoah and Kedesh and Hazor",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Gilead and Galilee were taken too",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The people deported to the lands of Assyria",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ahaz sent messengers with gold and silver",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the house of the LORD and royal treasuries",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To rescue him from Aram and the king of Israel",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The king who withdrew did not stay in the land",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Silver collected from the men of Israel",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A thousand talents paid for safety and peace",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The army turned away from the kingdom's gate",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God stirred up the spirit of Pul and Tilgath",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Carrying away the Reubenites and Gadites",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the half-tribe of Manasseh to exile",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Halah and Habor and Hara and the river",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
